<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sears raised to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sears raised to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Friday it had raised its rating for Sears, Roebuck and Co to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The retailer's shares rose one to 49 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
